    "title": "Visitor charged with assaulting deputy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Writer ,\n8 hours ago\nDUCK KEY — A 35-year-old Zolfo Springs man was arrested Sunday, Aug. 31, on Duck Key for allegedly assaulting a law enforcement officer.\nAndrew John Thompson was also charged with resisting arrest, according to the Monroe County Sheriff's Office.\nDeputies responded to a residence on Simran Lane at approximately 6:45 a.m. regarding a domestic disturbance. Thompson was intoxicated, enraged and physically aggressive with deputies, reports say.\nHe was shocked with a Taser and taken to jail.",
